Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:44.28,OT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2678,0)\an8\fs50}通知\N万分抱歉 本店重装升级中\N牛奶北斗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.13,0:00:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,樱井侑斗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.74,0:00:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,为了守护未来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,守护她以及她的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.12,0:00:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,同时另一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.81,0:00:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,出现在她的面前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.26,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那是年轻时期的樱井侑斗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.22,0:00:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,自消失的樱井侑斗的过去而来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他们同为一人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,却又不完全相同
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,至少对她而言是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.82,0:04:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,小良 午饭就简单点个披萨吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.60,0:04:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,小良
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,爱理小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.30,0:04:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,爱理小姐 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.90,0:04:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,尾崎先生 三浦先生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.45,0:04:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我带了吃的 要不要吃午饭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.02,0:04:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,很好吃的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.04,0:04:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真感谢你们 帮了大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.13,0:04:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,翻新之后感觉很不错呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,心情也随之一变
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.55,0:04:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,爱理小姐是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,也会感到有什么新的开始呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.93,0:04:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,比如一段新恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.68,0:04:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,等下 即使这样也不是你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.98,0:04:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那更加不可能是你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.19,0:04:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我正冲咖啡 一起喝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,小良 能帮我拿下杯子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.57,0:04:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就在那边的纸箱里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.32,0:04:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:53.41,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,老子 登场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,桃塔罗斯 你怎么来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.79,0:04:57.53,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,好久不见 良太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.34,0:05:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,先不说这个 你来得不是时候呀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:02.55,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我们这儿也很麻烦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.01,0:05:04.61,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,稍微借用一下你的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.12,0:05:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.26,0:05:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,小良
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.74,0:05:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你等等 桃塔罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.05,0:05:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦是指什么麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.98,0:05:18.69,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,Den-Liner失控了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:20.61,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,连车长大叔也搞不定
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.70,0:05:23.57,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,好险
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:27.78,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,让开 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.16,0:05:30.12,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,在时间中游荡的异魔神
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.20,0:05:32.00,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,潜进了Den-Liner
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.33,0:05:35.54,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,还往里头插进了奇怪的车票
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:37.42,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,Den-Liner都被搞坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.17,0:05:40.59,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,随意行驶 随意停车
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.97,0:05:42.80,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,没办法自由下车了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.59,0:05:45.76,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,实在没办法 我就只好飞来找你了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.09,0:05:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗 那岂不是很严重
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.51,0:05:50.33,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,大叔应该会做点什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.39,0:05:53.18,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我正要去揍那个混蛋异魔神
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.62,0:05:55.50,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,他肯定就在这个时间点里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.44,0:05:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你说这个时间点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.77,0:06:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你该不会是在随便瞎跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.40,0:06:02.92,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,跑着跑着自然就会发现它的踪迹了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.21,0:06:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真是 你还是老样子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:06:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.98,0:06:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还让你们陪我一起买东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不会 毕竟咖啡杯很重
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.71,0:07:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那搬东西就交给三浦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们两个来挑杯子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.71,0:07:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你的品味配得上牛奶北斗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.97,0:07:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,挑茶碗的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,三浦你倒是很合适呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,疼 疼 好疼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.77,0:07:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能没事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.27,0:07:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你说怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.70,0:07:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你说怎么办吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.69,0:07:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我可看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是你们自己撞上来的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这么拙劣的碰瓷真是好久不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,爱理小姐 这种人无视就好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,无视 无视 无视 无视
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.41,0:07:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,一边去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:43.66,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.38,0:07:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,别管那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.17,0:07:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐姐 和我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.34,0:07:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你也来尝尝同样的滋味吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.34,0:07:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 住手 住手 住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.60,0:07:58.44,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,不如也让我尝尝同样的滋味吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,疼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.19,0:08:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,小良
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.69,0:08:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你这小鬼想干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:08.40,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,想打架吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.94,0:08:11.69,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你倒是很有胆量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 桃塔罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,手下留情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.41,0:08:19.72,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,有味道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.87,0:08:22.82,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,这些家伙和异魔神有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.89,0:08:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,疼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.56,0:08:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,请 请等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也只是受人之托
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.43,0:08:34.32,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:36.09,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,是个到处撒沙子的家伙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.35,0:08:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,沙子 那我不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,只知道是个年轻男人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.98,0:08:41.81,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,他在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他应该就在附近看着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.98,0:08:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.29,0:08:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,侑斗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 站住
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.76,0:08:58.50,DefaultTOP,,0,0,0,,桃塔罗斯 还是先去找侑斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.83,0:09:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.17,0:09:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 都怪我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:20.13,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:22.39,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,那些混蛋说的年轻男人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.78,0:09:23.60,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,难道是他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.23,0:09:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会 难道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.44,0:09:28.73,Urataros,,0,0,0,,前辈 快回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.32,0:09:30.86,Urataros,,0,0,0,,Den-Liner现在停下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:31.96,Urataros,,0,0,0,,良太郎也上车吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.99,0:09:33.58,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.16,0:09:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,良太郎 好久不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:49.68,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,是良太郎 良太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.26,0:09:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,良太郎 你能来真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.05,0:09:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,叶奈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.05,0:09:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说Den-Liner出故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.59,0:10:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 现在我们去不了想去的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.47,0:10:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,也无法停车
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:02.76,Urataros,,0,0,0,,那是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:06.64,Urataros,,0,0,0,,异魔神插入了一张没有日期的车票
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,没有日期
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.19,0:10:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,上面虽然写着2010年1月
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.03,0:10:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有指定具体日期
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,所以列车就在2010年1月里到处乱开
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.54,0:10:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.63,0:10:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.97,0:10:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.93,0:10:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.85,0:10:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 列车还在不断加速
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.48,0:10:49.44,Urataros,,0,0,0,,这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.77,0:10:51.74,Urataros,,0,0,0,,列车可能会脱轨撞到什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.94,0:10:53.38,Urataros,,0,0,0,,或是跌入山谷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然现在还可以手动刹车
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.28,0:10:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但好像没法坚持太长时间
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.82,0:11:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,乘客也因为去不了车票上的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.91,0:11:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,跑来投诉我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.70,0:11:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但为什么异魔神要这么做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.71,0:11:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那当然
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.17,0:11:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为他想躲开我们的追踪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,车长 列车真的能够顺利到站吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.34,0:11:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我想去终点站
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.51,0:11:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,请放心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.77,0:11:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Den-Liner会准时到站
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.31,0:11:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,也会准时发车
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.94,0:11:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,祝各位旅途愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.53,0:11:42.11,Urataros,,0,0,0,,还是什么都没说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.94,0:11:43.70,Urataros,,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.45,0:11:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,异魔神的愿望是得到自己的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:11:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,说出你的愿望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.72,0:12:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,无论什么愿望我都能帮你实现
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.05,0:12:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,先和某个人定下契约
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,实现那个人的愿望后
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.40,0:12:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,再闯进他的过去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.85,0:12:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,之后以他的身份活着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.11,0:12:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那个人的时间就为异魔神所有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.93,0:12:25.77,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,姓桃的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:29.04,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,你说发现了异魔神才跑出去的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.87,0:12:30.70,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:32.66,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,肯定是让他给逃了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:35.04,Urataros,,0,0,0,,对啊 毕竟是前辈呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.13,0:12:35.92,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,说的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:37.16,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,别说傻话了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.17,0:12:40.26,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我确实发现带着异魔神味道的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:45.93,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,只是 出现在那里的人是侑斗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.73,0:12:54.94,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,难道那是胖四的味道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.68,0:12:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事 你说侑斗在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:13:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对 是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.39,0:13:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.39,0:13:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,侑斗他袭击了爱理小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.65,0:13:39.06,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,怎么回事 我要找他报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.07,0:13:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 还没有确定
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.03,0:13:44.11,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,不过那些家伙不是说了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:46.11,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,是受一个年轻男人的指示
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:48.32,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,当时那附近可只有他一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.34,0:13:49.82,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,我要去报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:57.60,Deneb,,0,0,0,,对不起 这其中是有隐情的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.62,0:13:58.17,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,胖四
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.79,0:13:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:00.46,Urataros,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:01.33,Deneb,,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.59,0:14:03.55,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,果然是你和侑斗干的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.13,0:14:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,骗人的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.59,0:14:07.76,Deneb,,0,0,0,,不 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.72,0:14:11.22,Deneb,,0,0,0,,是我给他提的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.89,0:14:13.26,Deneb,,0,0,0,,因为侑斗无论如何都不愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:15.77,Deneb,,0,0,0,,去见爱理小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.19,0:14:19.94,Deneb,,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.02,0:14:21.90,Deneb,,0,0,0,,和我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.94,0:14:22.57,Deneb,,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.73,0:14:23.73,Deneb,,0,0,0,,慢着
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.07,0:14:26.82,Deneb,,0,0,0,,不许你们碰爱理小姐一根手指头
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.11,0:14:28.82,Deneb,,0,0,0,,看我樱井侑斗怎么对付你们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.87,0:14:33.91,Deneb,,0,0,0,,混蛋 怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.33,0:14:36.71,Deneb,,0,0,0,,认输了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.25,0:14:42.94,Deneb,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.93,0:14:51.30,Deneb,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 樱井
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.64,0:15:00.81,Deneb,,0,0,0,,从今往后 我会一直守护你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.48,0:15:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好开心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.38,0:15:05.53,Deneb,,0,0,0,,好 结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.64,0:15:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.53,0:15:10.29,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,姐姐才不会那样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.82,0:15:14.33,Deneb,,0,0,0,,不过这样就能非常自然地
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:15.74,Deneb,,0,0,0,,和爱理小姐见面了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.77,0:15:17.29,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,一点都不自然
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.62,0:15:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是这真的是侑斗干的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.10,0:15:22.67,Deneb,,0,0,0,,不 我这么提议的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:24.44,Deneb,,0,0,0,,他相当生气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:26.78,Deneb,,0,0,0,,把我赶出了Zero-Liner
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:28.92,Deneb,,0,0,0,,我擅自来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:30.13,Deneb,,0,0,0,,承蒙各位关照
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.17,0:15:30.84,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,什么时候上来的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.89,0:15:32.97,Deneb,,0,0,0,,但他好像还是那么做了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.39,0:15:34.97,Deneb,,0,0,0,,虽然失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:37.64,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,那当然了 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.89,0:15:41.10,Urataros,,0,0,0,,怎么能用那种手段接近女性呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.20,0:15:41.73,Urataros,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:44.90,Urataros,,0,0,0,,太老套了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.73,0:15:48.07,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,再说 根本不用费这些工夫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.82,0:15:50.90,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,良太郎姐姐的未婚夫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.91,0:15:52.24,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,就是未来的侑斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.49,0:15:53.11,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,别想那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.12,0:15:54.37,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,直接去见她不行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:54.99,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:16:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,可能还是有点不同
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这样下去不知道什么时候又会失控
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.84,0:16:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,总之先麻烦大家进行应急处理了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.64,0:16:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.10,0:16:24.81,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:27.07,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,我跳
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.73,0:16:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,小龙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.57,0:16:31.78,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,你干嘛 不要妨碍我呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.41,0:16:34.20,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,别啰嗦了 好好干吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.20,0:16:35.07,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,好好干
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:37.37,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,良太郎 木桩 拿木桩来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:45.67,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,良太郎 刚才你说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.41,0:16:48.38,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,姐姐觉得有点不同
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.55,0:16:49.36,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,是什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.54,0:16:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,解释起来有点困难
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.47,0:16:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觉得在姐姐心中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.97,0:16:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,樱井大哥和侑斗并不是同一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.77,0:17:00.56,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.18,0:17:02.66,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,虽然年龄确实不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.31,0:17:06.17,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,可樱井侑斗就是樱井侑斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.78,0:17:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,叶奈就算变小了也还是她
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:13.99,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.41,0:17:17.91,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,臭女人还是臭女人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:20.87,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.01,0:17:22.12,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你看是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因为叶奈的内在没有改变
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.17,0:17:25.76,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}瞧你干的好事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.59,0:17:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我不清楚该怎么表达
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.13,0:17:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,总之 那个消失的樱井大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.76,0:17:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,现在也还在姐姐心里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我想侑斗他也明白这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.62,0:18:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐 谁允许你在这里开店的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.71,0:18:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我父母在的时候就有这家店了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.96,0:18:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没听说过啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.34,0:18:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在就给你点苦头尝尝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.08,0:18:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.10,0:18:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,请快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么 快给我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,听到没 快给我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.62,0:18:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,樱井
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.73,0:18:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你是干什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.17,0:18:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这跟说好的不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.13,0:18:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.27,0:19:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.73,0:19:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.03,0:19:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.55,0:19:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,请等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.63,0:19:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然只能给你泡杯咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.05,0:19:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但还是请坐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.10,0:19:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.69,0:19:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶啊 那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.57,0:19:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好不容易轮到我出场了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.11,0:20:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,突然冒出来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.03,0:20:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,又轻易地就解决问题
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.49,0:20:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我有这种自信吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.34,0:20:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你是笨蛋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.81,0:20:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然两次都失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.40,0:20:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 是蠢货
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.86,0:20:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢货 蠢货 蠢货
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.04,0:20:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,烦死了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:48.41,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,有气味 是异魔神
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.08,0:20:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,桃塔罗斯 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.12,0:20:52.42,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,让我来吧 良太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.17,0:20:54.75,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,你在干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.04,0:20:56.79,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,毕竟上年纪了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.84,0:20:57.29,Urataros,,0,0,0,,说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.42,0:20:58.61,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,粗暴疗法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.92,0:21:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,异魔神在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.55,0:21:03.98,Deneb,,0,0,0,,慢点 小龙 没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:05.18,Urataros,,0,0,0,,真没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.93,0:21:10.29,Urataros,,0,0,0,,良太郎 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你太磨蹭了 磨磨唧唧的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.69,0:21:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 是迟钝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.11,0:21:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,2次都让人抢走那么好的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.41,0:21:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,迟钝的家伙 迟钝的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.88,0:21:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了 别管我了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,许愿的人不是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.62,0:21:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,想通过英雄救美吸引那个女人的注意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.79,0:21:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,再不尽快完成契约的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.50,0:21:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我就无法行动了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.13,0:21:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我认真点
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.22,0:21:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:47.22,Urataros,,0,0,0,,原来是你们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.85,0:21:53.85,Urataros,,0,0,0,,旁边的小哥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.69,0:21:57.45,Urataros,,0,0,0,,用那种手段
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.50,0:21:59.46,Urataros,,0,0,0,,女性可不会上钩哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.11,0:22:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你是Den-O吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.74,0:22:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不是啊 是Den-O啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.60,0:22:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,还不是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.66,0:22:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Den-O Den-O
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.20,0:22:12.10,Urataros,,0,0,0,,你那个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.16,0:22:14.79,Urataros,,0,0,0,,让我有种似曾相识的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.83,0:22:17.25,Urataros,,0,0,0,,也罢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.13,0:22:21.93,Urataros,,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.42,0:22:24.73,Urataros,,0,0,0,,ROD FORM
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.52,0:22:37.25,Urataros,,0,0,0,,试着上我的钩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.31,0:22:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴吧 都到这一步了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.44,0:22:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么能让你来捣乱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.41,0:22:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.57,0:23:26.90,Deneb,,0,0,0,,你没事吧 龟塔罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.40,0:23:28.15,Urataros,,0,0,0,,谢谢啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.61,0:23:30.16,Urataros,,0,0,0,,不过我不叫龟塔罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.24,0:23:31.91,Urataros,,0,0,0,,而是浦塔罗斯 小胖四
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.45,0:23:33.01,Deneb,,0,0,0,,我叫天津四
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.62,0:23:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还有帮手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.58,0:23:38.05,Deneb,,0,0,0,,是天津四 你等等
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.75,0:23:45.00,Urataros,,0,0,0,,跑得真快
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.76,0:23:46.50,Deneb,,0,0,0,,刚才那个就是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.84,0:23:48.42,Deneb,,0,0,0,,弄坏Den-Liner的异魔神吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.94,0:23:49.38,Urataros,,0,0,0,,就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.09,0:23:52.64,Urataros,,0,0,0,,而且他还和想追爱理小姐的废柴男
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.72,0:23:53.68,Urataros,,0,0,0,,签订了契约
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.85,0:23:54.61,Deneb,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.31,0:23:56.20,Deneb,,0,0,0,,什么！ 契约？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.47,0:25:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,请用
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.01,0:25:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 先别放糖试着喝一口
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.23,0:25:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这款咖啡比较甜
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.94,0:25:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直想着下次樱井你来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.78,0:25:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要请你尝尝看
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.20,0:25:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,女孩子基本上都喜欢这款
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.41,0:25:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.96,0:25:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 也有成年男性喜欢这种咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.79,0:25:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,当然我也喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.97,0:25:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我惹你不开心了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.10,0:26:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.47,0:26:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我的口味的确有点孩子气
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.23,0:26:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是甜的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.33,0:26:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,品尝过第一口后就放糖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.00,0:26:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.67,0:26:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,喝咖啡时加糖加奶的人 在世上还是占多数
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.37,0:27:18.94,Deneb,,0,0,0,,气氛好像不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.51,0:27:20.64,Deneb,,0,0,0,,干得好 侑斗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.39,0:27:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,小声点
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.60,0:27:23.22,Deneb,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.53,0:27:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,侑斗他从什么时候开始不放糖的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.04,0:27:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚认识他的时候 他就已经不放了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.61,0:28:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,还是说
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.28,0:28:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,已经产生差异了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.78,0:28:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,樱井
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.00,0:28:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,本应成为你未来模样的侑斗已经消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.21,0:28:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经不会被未来束缚了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.26,0:28:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.42,0:29:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管如此
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.22,0:29:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想再见你一面
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.86,0:29:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,侑斗他
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.65,0:29:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,选择守护这段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.78,0:29:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我和联系我们的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.37,0:29:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,即使他知道自己会消失
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.37,0:29:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,侑斗他就是这样的一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.02,0:30:18.98,Deneb,,0,0,0,,你说的没错
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.23,0:30:23.37,Deneb,,0,0,0,,樱井深深地铭刻在爱理小姐心中
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.61,0:30:27.30,Deneb,,0,0,0,,为什么啊 他们明明是同一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.70,0:30:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因为樱井大哥做了非常了不起的事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.17,0:30:39.33,Deneb,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.49,0:30:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 这次你可要好好干啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.19,0:30:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.23,0:31:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你也一定要按照我说的去做
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.98,0:31:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我去袭击那个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.82,0:31:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,把来救人的那个叫樱井的家伙干掉
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.11,0:31:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.07,0:31:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你就可以登场
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.45,0:31:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,把她救下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.29,0:31:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.17,0:31:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这次我一定
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.63,0:31:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要堂堂正正地站在她面前
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.89,0:31:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这次
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.18,0:31:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,出现在她面前的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.15,0:31:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.86,0:31:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不是啊 是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.19,0:31:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是你是你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.11,0:31:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 是你登场
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.41,0:31:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们的契约就完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.82,0:32:26.44,Deneb,,0,0,0,,侑斗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.28,0:32:31.86,Deneb,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.45,0:32:37.45,Deneb,,0,0,0,,关于你和爱理小姐的事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.83,0:32:39.05,Deneb,,0,0,0,,我说了好多蠢话 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.16,0:32:43.17,Deneb,,0,0,0,,还好你没有采用我的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.25,0:32:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫不会被未来束缚
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.59,0:32:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,明明已经被绑死了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.96,0:33:00.68,Deneb,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.06,0:33:04.81,Deneb,,0,0,0,,如果因为你们同为樱井侑斗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.81,0:33:05.84,Deneb,,0,0,0,,所以才不行的话
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.40,0:33:09.28,Deneb,,0,0,0,,下次假扮成另一个人就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.95,0:33:13.15,Deneb,,0,0,0,,好 马上动手准备吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.95,0:33:15.46,Deneb,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.08,0:33:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,天津四
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.91,0:33:22.29,Deneb,,0,0,0,,你干什么啊 侑斗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.96,0:33:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是你脑子不好使啊 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.50,0:33:26.25,Deneb,,0,0,0,,好疼好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.75,0:33:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.84,0:33:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,石头剪刀布
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.34,0:33:33.94,Deneb,,0,0,0,,好过分
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.98,0:33:44.72,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,转圈转圈
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.77,0:33:49.66,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,别乱按啊 你这个臭女人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.40,0:33:49.90,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}我完全没搞懂
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.40,0:33:52.24,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,只是年龄不一样为什么就不行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.61,0:33:55.36,Urataros,,0,0,0,,这是个细腻的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.53,0:33:58.83,Urataros,,0,0,0,,小金和前辈大概是搞不懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.87,0:34:00.28,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你别太得意
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.49,0:34:03.16,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我不是不明白 是不想搞明白
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.16,0:34:03.94,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,太麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.08,0:34:05.70,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,别把我和肌肉笨蛋混为一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.75,0:34:06.92,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,你叫我肌肉笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.13,0:34:08.98,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,就算你说得对 我也饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.84,0:34:12.42,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,杀人啦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.80,0:34:13.05,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}治好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.55,0:34:14.01,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,杀桃啦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.01,0:34:16.93,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,手指要折了 不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.72,0:34:16.09,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}姓桃的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.97,0:34:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,现在与未来总是很难联系起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.85,0:34:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,老实说
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.93,0:34:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我也对侑斗和爱理小姐的事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.81,0:34:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么实感
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.44,0:34:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,确实是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.11,0:34:32.23,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,随便怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.65,0:34:34.05,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,只要姐姐好就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.78,0:34:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,您在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.79,0:34:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚终点站的站长联系我了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.71,0:34:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那我先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.26,0:34:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我得回去陪姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.72,0:34:58.80,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,异魔神出现的话记得叫我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.00,0:35:02.62,Urataros,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.22,0:35:03.98,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,再见啦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.14,0:35:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,车长
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.09,0:35:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,手动刹车果然撑不了多久
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.60,0:35:45.29,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,这可怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.22,0:35:45.52,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}我的腰 腰
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.44,0:35:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,无法控制
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.81,0:35:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能去2010年的1月
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.65,0:35:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.71,0:36:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.60,0:36:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 请不要太过勉强
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.27,0:36:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.39,0:36:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经完全复活了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.77,0:36:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不能让爱理小姐一个人走
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.36,0:36:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,女人 我要吃了你
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.95,0:36:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别想得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.25,0:36:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.41,0:36:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,尾崎先生 三浦先生
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.64,0:37:11.69,Deneb,,0,0,0,,还好我们一直在旁边守着
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.69,0:37:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,侑斗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.65,0:37:14.48,Deneb,,0,0,0,,野上
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.44,0:37:17.00,Deneb,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.15,0:37:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.74,0:37:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.66,0:37:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Den-Liner又失控了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.71,0:37:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,情况比刚开始的时候更糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.91,0:37:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,根本联系不上桃塔罗斯他们
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.29,0:37:35.92,Deneb,,0,0,0,,那你不就没法变身成Den-O了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.92,0:37:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋 那你来干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.09,0:37:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,总比在旁边看着要好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.17,0:37:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是老样子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.26,0:37:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你是干嘛的 一边去
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.15,0:38:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,小良
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.28,0:38:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,小良
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.29,0:38:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.20,0:38:07.13,Deneb,,0,0,0,,野上
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.99,0:38:08.83,Deneb,,0,0,0,,侑斗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.08,0:38:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.46,0:38:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,天津四 我们上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.42,0:38:20.86,Deneb,,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.92,0:38:23.80,Deneb,,0,0,0,,CHARGE AND UP
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.84,0:38:29.14,Deneb,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4BAC63&\c&H2D236B&}DENEBICK BUSTER
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.06,0:38:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,别反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.44,0:38:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不然后果自负
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.98,0:38:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4BAC63&\c&H2D236B&}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.65,0:38:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到那辆卡车了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.11,0:38:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我的契约者就在车上
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.28,0:38:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,万一这次也失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.53,0:38:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙就会自暴自弃
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.07,0:38:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,驾驶卡车横冲直撞
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.99,0:38:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那辆车里可是装满了汽油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.70,0:38:54.41,Deneb,,0,0,0,,为什么要这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.54,0:38:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你只要乖乖被我打倒
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.71,0:38:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,由他去救那个女人就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.97,0:39:13.52,Deneb,,0,0,0,,侑斗 我们怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.81,0:39:15.52,Deneb,,0,0,0,,就这么认输吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.56,0:39:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,现在先让他实现自己的愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.65,0:39:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,之后就好办了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.61,0:39:20.52,Deneb,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.32,0:39:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.24,0:39:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我待会儿冲上前去救她
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.32,0:39:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,以英雄的姿态出现在她眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.78,0:39:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,等他下次倒下的时候 就冲过去
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.77,0:39:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.90,0:40:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,爱理小姐 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.61,0:40:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,菊地先生
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.74,0:40:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.28,0:40:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是我的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.46,0:40:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.50,0:40:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,下次 等下一个机会就上
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.13,0:40:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.60,0:40:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,樱井
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.68,0:40:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.41,0:40:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.98,0:40:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙要让我等到什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.48,0:40:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,上 上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.16,0:40:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,等他再打一拳
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.28,0:40:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.41,0:40:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,就是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.04,0:41:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好 下次吧 下次
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.34,0:41:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我忍不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.65,0:41:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,闪开
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.50,0:41:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.48,0:41:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4BAC63&\c&H2D236B&}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.90,0:41:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,上车
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.82,0:41:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这样一来你就成功救过那个女人了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.57,0:41:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,听懂了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.28,0:41:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.24,0:41:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不是啦 是我们的契约完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.05,0:41:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,完成 完成
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.17,0:41:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要 不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.72,0:41:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你小子
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.38,0:41:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,开门 快开门
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.96,0:41:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 老是等到这种时候才行动
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.85,0:42:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,停车 你给我停车
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.62,0:42:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不该是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.06,0:42:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须要帅气地在她面前登场
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.31,0:42:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4BAC63&\c&H2D236B&}真是的 到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.74,0:42:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我得跟上去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.08,0:42:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,桃塔罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.09,0:42:30.20,Urataros,,0,0,0,,不行 不能往这边
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.68,0:42:32.88,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,小熊 你给点力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.17,0:42:35.55,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,可恶 还不快老实听话
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.39,0:42:39.34,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,姓龟的 你压好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.37,0:42:43.30,Urataros,,0,0,0,,小金 你搞坏了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.81,0:42:45.23,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,小熊你这个空有力气的笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.06,0:42:45.64,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}我也不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.56,0:42:47.52,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,只能睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.61,0:42:48.44,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,我不管
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.61,0:42:50.40,Urataros,,0,0,0,,这也坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.86,0:42:55.65,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我的腰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.24,0:42:59.49,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,腰
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.21,0:43:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.51,0:43:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.13,0:43:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,假的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.02,0:43:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 快停车
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.73,0:43:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.98,0:43:31.48,DefaultTOP,,0,0,0,,停车
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.94,0:43:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.42,0:43:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 该死
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.05,0:44:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4BAC63&\c&H2D236B&}可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.58,0:44:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.96,0:44:29.21,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,不要啊 别过来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.21,0:44:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是桃塔罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.46,0:44:31.88,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,别过来 一边去
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.00,0:44:32.92,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我叫你到一边去
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.50,0:44:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,桃塔罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.05,0:44:38.76,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,良太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.14,0:44:42.80,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,良太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.39,0:44:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.60,0:44:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么从Den-Liner出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.14,0:44:51.16,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,还好你来了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.52,0:44:53.48,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,Den-Liner晃得太厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.48,0:44:55.90,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我腰疼得受不了就跳车了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.40,0:44:58.69,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,就在Den-Liner经过今年1月
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.69,0:44:59.44,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,某一天的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.67,0:45:16.46,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我的腰
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.13,0:45:21.72,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,跳车让我的腰伤得更重了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.93,0:45:22.97,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,其他人也都不在
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.72,0:45:26.85,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我就一直留在这里靠他们照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.97,0:45:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚说今年一月
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.23,0:45:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那你已经在这儿待了4个月了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.69,0:45:34.31,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,好辛苦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.11,0:45:37.02,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,真是太辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.36,0:45:39.11,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,要是跟你细说我的艰辛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.36,0:45:41.24,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,不过 话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.32,0:45:42.11,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我看到那个
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.11,0:45:43.41,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,和异魔神定下契约的家伙了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.58,0:45:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.32,0:46:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.29,0:46:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙走光了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.61,0:46:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.74,0:46:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.41,0:46:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.92,0:46:41.53,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,他那样根本没脸再出现在姐姐面前
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.34,0:46:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.68,0:46:51.74,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我也以为再也见不到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.53,0:46:53.31,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.53,0:46:55.02,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.23,0:46:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦你了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.65,0:46:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你出现得正好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.02,0:47:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在追异魔神
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.22,0:47:01.98,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.15,0:47:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你的腰没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.82,0:47:07.28,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,笨蛋 都4个月了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.28,0:47:08.20,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,完全没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.58,0:47:13.33,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,源哥 承蒙你照顾了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.87,0:47:15.75,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,保重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.43,0:47:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,总之 只要能回到过去
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.97,0:47:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我们说了算
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.77,0:47:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.36,0:47:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.96,0:47:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,疼
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.81,0:47:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.80,0:47:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.91,0:47:57.90,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.49,0:48:00.33,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,站住 站住 站住
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.33,0:48:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,桃塔罗斯 危险
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.25,0:48:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,快停下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.84,0:48:02.59,DefaultTOP,,0,0,0,,你快停下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.67,0:48:07.05,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,好疼 好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.14,0:48:10.61,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.10,0:48:12.74,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我终于逮到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.43,0:48:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Den-O
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.56,0:48:17.25,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.85,0:48:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,桃塔罗斯 我们上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.61,0:48:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.18,0:48:26.28,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,SWORD FORM
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.09,0:48:28.95,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,给我等着
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.49,0:48:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.49,0:48:37.36,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,老子 登场
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.67,0:48:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,什么登场啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.58,0:48:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你别来碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.21,0:48:48.17,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,别那么冷淡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.52,0:48:52.76,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我可是从4个月前开始就火力全开
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.93,0:48:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个麻烦的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.47,0:48:57.77,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,来吧 来吧 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.24,0:49:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪 怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.60,0:49:36.37,Deneb,,0,0,0,,危险 赶紧停车
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.12,0:49:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,刹车失灵 停不下来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.61,0:49:40.14,Deneb,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.14,0:50:11.84,Deneb,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.25,0:50:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我去救人 你搞定卡车
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.47,0:50:14.97,Deneb,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.42,0:50:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,樱井
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.89,0:50:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上救你出去
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.91,0:50:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,情况很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.20,0:50:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.67,0:50:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.80,0:50:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,要跳了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.62,0:51:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,列车马上就要坠落了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.37,0:51:26.25,Urataros,,0,0,0,,不要广播这种内容啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.66,0:51:26.77,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,你在说什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.56,0:51:47.65,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,这是云霄飞车啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.19,0:51:48.85,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.18,0:52:04.74,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,我还挺喜欢这瞬间的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.75,0:52:05.57,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.57,0:52:37.03,Deneb,,0,0,0,,万幸
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.65,0:52:40.86,Deneb,,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.07,0:53:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到你这无聊的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.53,0:53:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还挺能打的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.82,0:53:25.03,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,无聊是多余的 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.41,0:53:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么了 火力全开混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.41,0:53:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就这点本事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.41,0:53:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,别搞笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.79,0:53:32.81,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,马上让你见识下我的实力
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.74,0:53:45.55,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.06,0:53:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我接住啦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.97,0:53:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉他 干掉他
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.69,0:54:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,桃塔罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.54,0:54:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,桃塔罗斯 我们马上就到
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.54,0:54:16.33,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.79,0:54:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.30,0:54:20.06,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,好得很 幸好有站长在
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.69,0:54:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,维修服务及时抵达了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.53,0:54:42.82,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,好吧 那就过来帮忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.80,0:54:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000FF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\clip(m 751 1055 l 926 1054 794 955)}CLIMAX FORM
Dialogue: 1,0:54:45.80,0:54:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HB27906&\3c&HFFFFFF&\clip(m 829 984 l 932 1059 984 1058 982 982)}CLIMAX FORM
Dialogue: 2,0:54:45.80,0:54:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H56CBF2&\3c&HFFFFFF&\clip(m 985 976 l 994 1067 1110 1052 1032 986)}CLIMAX FORM
Dialogue: 3,0:54:45.80,0:54:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HED77AA&\3c&HFFFFFF&\clip(m 1009 982 l 1106 1059 1152 1054 1150 974)}CLIMAX FORM
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.25,0:54:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,大家 我们合体吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.32,0:54:52.91,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.21,0:54:54.29,Urataros,,0,0,0,,嗯 久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.97,0:55:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.22,0:55:12.00,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,奇怪 前辈你好像有些憔悴呀
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.06,0:55:13.24,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,存在感好弱
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.52,0:55:15.98,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,本来就没什么存在感吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.27,0:55:17.94,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,你们不觉得有股流浪狗的味道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.94,0:55:18.69,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,好臭
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.69,0:55:20.69,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,啰嗦 别提到流浪狗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.03,0:55:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么回事 好恶心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.29,0:55:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不对啦 是倒胃口
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.33,0:55:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,恶心 恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.16,0:55:33.22,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,吵死了 不许你说我恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.29,0:55:35.80,Urataros,,0,0,0,,你们有什么资格说别人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.25,0:55:39.33,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,说起合体 我们才是鼻祖
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.63,0:55:41.70,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,还比你们多一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.38,0:55:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是哦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.24,0:55:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.34,0:55:46.30,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,4对3 我们赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.30,0:55:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.47,0:55:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都认真点
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.64,0:55:50.22,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,赶紧了结他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.47,0:55:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,要被了结的是你们
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.39,0:55:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,消失吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.70,0:55:59.10,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,来吧 我们的必杀技
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.32,0:56:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.02,0:56:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.74,0:56:03.24,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,火力全开式
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.74,0:56:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我的弟弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.66,0:56:08.66,DefaultTOP,,0,0,0,,大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.95,0:56:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.12,0:56:13.79,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,让我费这么大劲儿
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.77,0:56:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,情况很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.44,0:56:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.03,0:56:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,要跳了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.64,0:58:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 野上很担心你
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.56,0:58:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,来 小胖四 请用
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.52,0:58:41.73,Deneb,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.06,0:58:44.14,Urataros,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 小直美
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.15,0:58:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,天津四 不要那么失望嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.57,0:58:48.94,Deneb,,0,0,0,,多谢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.19,0:58:53.11,Urataros,,0,0,0,,女人心不是那么容易能被打动的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.32,0:58:55.20,Deneb,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.09,0:58:59.98,Deneb,,0,0,0,,只是樱井的存在实在太难超越
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.29,0:59:02.29,Deneb,,0,0,0,,我一想到侑斗的心情就
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.00,0:59:05.80,Urataros,,0,0,0,,没事的 放宽心
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.50,0:59:08.60,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,对手就是自己啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.88,0:59:11.98,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,的确很难办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.34,0:59:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 总有一天
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.14,1:00:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,可以陪我去看看吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.37,1:00:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真美啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.05,1:00:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,看 那是处女座
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.76,1:00:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那旁边就是狮子座
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.63,1:00:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的天空好清澈啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.72,1:00:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,要是有带望远镜就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.14,1:04:51.02,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,好久没这么舒服地洗澡了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.55,1:04:52.77,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,直美 给我杯咖啡
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.35,1:04:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你等等小桃 请擦干了再出来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.23,1:04:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,水滴得到处都是了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.98,1:04:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.73,1:04:59.56,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}还是好臭
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.52,1:05:02.19,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,臭狗的味道
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.65,1:05:04.78,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你胡说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.69,1:05:07.11,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,是玫瑰的味道吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.57,1:05:09.46,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,是你的鼻子有毛病吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.53,1:05:12.74,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,臭臭臭臭臭臭
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.03,1:05:14.33,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,臭狗的味道
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.37,1:05:16.06,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,不许说狗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.62,1:05:17.54,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,别闹了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.96,1:05:23.71,Urataros,,0,0,0,,还真有股味道
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.17,1:05:25.00,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,笨蛋笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.09,1:05:26.88,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,安静 吵死了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.76,1:05:28.42,Urataros,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.80,1:05:30.47,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.43,1:05:32.89,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,离我远点
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.35,1:05:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,车长在干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.43,1:05:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不是说和站长有话要谈吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.65,1:05:43.44,Urataros,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.98,1:05:47.03,Urataros,,0,0,0,,总之和这次的事件完全没有关系
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.24,1:05:48.18,Urataros,,0,0,0,,真是吓了一跳
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.62,1:05:58.14,Deneb,,0,0,0,,今天的味道比往常更苦啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.16,1:07:25.45,ED,,0,0,0,,历经长久的岁月亘古至今
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.91,1:07:31.33,ED,,0,0,0,,宁静夜空中散发的点点星光
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.58,1:07:42.43,ED,,0,0,0,,一同昂首凝视 此刻你我为何却不发一语
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.43,1:07:47.89,ED,,0,0,0,,夜空晴朗无云 唯有真诚的祈愿
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.06,1:07:52.40,ED,,0,0,0,,能够照亮这片星空
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.06,1:07:59.70,ED,,0,0,0,,一切尚未结束 余音绕梁
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.03,1:08:05.08,ED,,0,0,0,,此刻依旧回荡心中
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.58,1:08:14.29,ED,,0,0,0,,坚强的心意 坚定的愿望
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.29,1:08:19.34,ED,,0,0,0,,唯有如此 有朝一日一定...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.80,1:08:25.55,ED,,0,0,0,,现在虽然遥远的Vega & Altair
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.56,1:08:30.73,ED,,0,0,0,,也要实现 Action-Zero
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.14,1:08:36.82,ED,,0,0,0,,强烈的光芒 向星星许愿
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.82,1:08:42.15,ED,,0,0,0,,你是否还会记得？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.45,1:08:48.08,ED,,0,0,0,,抬头仰望着Vega & Altair
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.08,1:08:54.17,ED,,0,0,0,,那段时光的 Action-Zero
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.22,1:09:07.80,ED,,0,0,0,,坚强的心意 坚定的愿望
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.85,1:09:13.02,ED,,0,0,0,,唯有如此 有朝一日一定...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.56,1:09:19.19,ED,,0,0,0,,现在虽然遥远的Vega & Altair
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.19,1:09:24.40,ED,,0,0,0,,也要实现 Action-zero
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.86,1:09:32.54,ED,,0,0,0,,坚强的心意 坚定的愿望
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.17,1:09:44.93,ED,,0,0,0,,我跟你说 是相当地坚定
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.57,1:10:02.44,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,喂 羽毛掉进来了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.44,1:10:04.15,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,那边去 臭鸟
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.70,1:10:08.20,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,盖饭 你也要吃盖饭吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.03,1:10:11.87,Teddy,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.87,1:10:13.20,Urataros,,0,0,0,,这个很好吃的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.41,1:10:16.21,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,吃了会哭的哦 好吃 好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.71,1:10:17.67,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,快过来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.17,1:10:21.13,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,不过等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.50,1:10:23.71,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,盖饭吃盖饭这行吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.05,1:10:26.76,Urataros,,0,0,0,,这么说来也是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.88,1:10:29.43,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,盖饭吃盖饭？说重了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.43,1:10:31.05,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,那就不好办了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.56,1:10:33.06,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,我有点怕啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.06,1:10:37.44,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,不好意思 盖饭
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.44,1:10:39.94,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,因为盖饭吃盖饭好像不太好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.23,1:10:42.23,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,不 不 不过就算说着不太好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.23,1:10:47.53,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,盖饭是好吃 因为只有盖饭 所以盖饭就...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.78,1:10:52.28,Teddy,,0,0,0,,所以我不叫盖饭...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.29,1:10:56.00,Deneb,,0,0,0,,行了 行了 还是看这部电影 打起精神来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.46,1:11:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我想搞明白 却搞不明白
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.63,1:11:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你对我来说到底有多重要
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.38,1:11:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你会因为你不见的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.76,1:11:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说 是消失
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.39,1:11:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们会一直在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.80,1:11:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,把在一起视作是理所当然
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.94,1:11:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不要消失
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.07,1:11:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不要消失啊 泰迪
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.32,1:11:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,幸太郎
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.12,1:11:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我旅行的目的地由我自己决定
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.46,1:11:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这个时间好像有很强的执念啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.51,1:11:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,今后妨碍时间运行的人
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.68,1:11:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,由我们时间警察来制裁
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.89,1:11:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己想要除掉自己
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.39,1:11:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,就是为了那个宝物吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.60,1:12:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,永远失去的宝物
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.90,1:12:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我为了宝物的话可以豁出性命
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.07,1:12:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不能失去宝物
